body:
### Description

A small percentage of the time when using the Gemini "URL Context" feature we get a Zod validation error on the response due to a missing `title` property. 

The call:

```
const { text, providerMetadata, finishReason } = await generateText({
      model: vertex("gemini-2.5-flash"),
      tools: { url_context: vertex.tools.urlContext({}) as any },
      system: systemPrompt,
      prompt: `URL: ${url}\n\nPrompt: ${prompt}`,
      experimental_telemetry: { isEnabled: true },
    });
```


